---
// The motion "Traçado" on a page that has the plan or sections: the reveal
// of the sections and the progress bar and, on the Home page, the opening.
// It goes in the <head> of the page, through the slot "head" of the layout.
// A reading page does not use it: it gets the page change only, which is
// CSS of the layout.
import "../styles/motion-scroll.css";
---

<!--
  The switch of the motion: the class "motion", which every rule of the motion
  hangs on. It is put here, before the page shows, so that nothing shows whole
  and then starts over. With reduced motion asked of the system, or with
  JavaScript off, the class is never there and the page is still.
-->
<script is:inline>
  if (!matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches) {
    document.documentElement.classList.add("motion");
  }
</script>
<script src="../scripts/motion.ts"></script>
